{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 4802,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are three things the IRS can quietly\ndo to the money sitting in your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 4802,
    "dDurationMs": 4482,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "bank account right now, and it is counting\non one thing above all else."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9964,
    "dDurationMs": 4222,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That you will go your whole life never\nlearning that any of them exist."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14746,
    "dDurationMs": 2561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It does not send a letter to explain them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18067,
    "dDurationMs": 2261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your bank will never warn you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20688,
    "dDurationMs": 3802,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And two of the three can happen without a\nsingle judge ever signing off on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24490,
    "dDurationMs": 260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25570,
    "dDurationMs": 4642,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of these rules decides how much tax\nyou owe on money you already earned."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30953,
    "dDurationMs": 4722,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One of them can turn an ordinary, honest\ndeposit into a federal investigation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36635,
    "dDurationMs": 5122,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the last one, the one I truly want you\nto stay for, can freeze every single"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41757,
    "dDurationMs": 5422,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "dollar in your account in one quiet\nafternoon, before you even know it is happening."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47600,
    "dDurationMs": 3401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here is the part that catches good, honest\npeople."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51521,
    "dDurationMs": 3582,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not one of these three rules is a trap\nbecause it is complicated."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55943,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Each one is simple."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57904,
    "dDurationMs": 4682,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What destroys careful retirees is the one\nsmall mistake they make the moment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62586,
    "dDurationMs": 4922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they find out the rule exists, because\nthey react out of fear instead of knowledge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68248,
    "dDurationMs": 4422,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So stay with me, because I am going to\nwalk you through all three in plain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72670,
    "dDurationMs": 5362,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "language. Exactly what each rule is, who\nit touches, and the quiet mistake"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78032,
    "dDurationMs": 2501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that turns a harmless rule into a\ndisaster."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81333,
    "dDurationMs": 4122,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the end, you will understand your own\nbank account better than most people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85455,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ever will."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86996,
    "dDurationMs": 4422,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me start with the first rule, because\nit is the one that touches every"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91418,
    "dDurationMs": 4361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "single person watching, and it has quietly\ngotten more expensive in the last"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95779,
    "dDurationMs": 6003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "two years. It is this. Every dollar of\ninterest your bank pays you is reported"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101782,
    "dDurationMs": 4622,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "straight to the IRS, and every dollar of\nit is taxable income."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106664,
    "dDurationMs": 4802,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For years this barely mattered, because\nbanks paid almost nothing on your savings."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 112146,
    "dDurationMs": 4082,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But interest rates climbed, and now that\nordinary savings account you keep"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116228,
    "dDurationMs": 3221,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for emergencies is actually paying you\nreal money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120049,
    "dDurationMs": 2861,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For some of you that is a few hundred\ndollars a year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123571,
    "dDurationMs": 3521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For others with more set aside, it is well\nover a thousand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127592,
    "dDurationMs": 2521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here is what most seniors do not\nrealize."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130754,
    "dDurationMs": 3721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The moment your account pays you ten\ndollars or more in interest across the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134475,
    "dDurationMs": 5262,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "year, your bank sends a form to the IRS\nwith your name on it and the exact"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139737,
    "dDurationMs": 3202,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "amount you were paid. You might get a copy\nin the mail."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143479,
    "dDurationMs": 3341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The IRS always gets its copy, every time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147020,
    "dDurationMs": 3362,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is exactly where honest people\nget caught."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151222,
    "dDurationMs": 2341,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They forget about that small bit of\ninterest."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154223,
    "dDurationMs": 4682,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or the form never arrived, or it slipped\nbehind other mail, so they leave it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158905,
    "dDurationMs": 2881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "off their tax return believing it does not\nmatter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162627,
    "dDurationMs": 2301,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the IRS already has the number."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165708,
    "dDurationMs": 4562,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Its computers quietly match what your bank\nreported against what you actually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170270,
    "dDurationMs": 5722,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "filed, automatically, and when the two do\nnot match, a letter arrives months"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 175992,
    "dDurationMs": 6063,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "later asking for the tax you missed, plus\ninterest on it, plus a penalty, all"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182055,
    "dDurationMs": 1881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on money you barely remembered earning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184936,
    "dDurationMs": 2161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Understand the rule and it is nothing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188237,
    "dDurationMs": 2261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ignore it and it becomes a bill."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192099,
    "dDurationMs": 4922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there is a sharper edge to this first\nrule that almost nobody knows about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 197741,
    "dDurationMs": 4382,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the name or the Social Security number\non your account does not perfectly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 202123,
    "dDurationMs": 5462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "match the government's records, or if the\nIRS has flagged you, the bank is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 207585,
    "dDurationMs": 4802,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "required to hold back twenty four percent\nof your interest and send it straight"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212387,
    "dDurationMs": 4242,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the IRS, before a single dollar of it\never reaches you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217089,
    "dDurationMs": 3882,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is called backup withholding, and it\nhappens automatically."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221831,
    "dDurationMs": 2221,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the first rule is simple to live with."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224572,
    "dDurationMs": 1881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every dollar of interest is seen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226953,
    "dDurationMs": 5502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Report all of it, even a few dollars, even\nwhen no form arrives, because they"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232455,
    "dDurationMs": 1541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "already have it in front of them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234676,
    "dDurationMs": 5923,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let me make this real for a moment,\nbecause it is easy to wave off as too"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242099,
    "dDurationMs": 3382,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "small to matter. Picture a woman who\nfinally moved thirty thousand dollars"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245481,
    "dDurationMs": 4702,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of her savings into one of those higher\npaying accounts, proud of herself for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250183,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "earning something on it at last."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252804,
    "dDurationMs": 3721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That account might pay her well over a\nthousand dollars in interest across"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256525,
    "dDurationMs": 561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257906,
    "dDurationMs": 5022,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every bit of that is reported, and every\nbit of it is taxable, and if she leaves"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262928,
    "dDurationMs": 2581,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it off her return because it felt like\nnothing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266229,
    "dDurationMs": 3522,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the letter that comes back to her will not\nfeel like nothing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 269771,
    "dDurationMs": 2901,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is not a rule that punishes the\nwealthy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 273312,
    "dDurationMs": 4782,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is a rule that quietly catches the\ncareful saver who did exactly the right"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278094,
    "dDurationMs": 4042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thing and simply never knew the money\nwould be counted against her."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282436,
    "dDurationMs": 4622,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now let me give you the second rule, the\none that can quietly turn your own"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287058,
    "dDurationMs": 4602,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "money into a criminal problem, and almost\nnobody understands how it truly works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 292260,
    "dDurationMs": 5102,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Here it is. When you move a large amount\nof cash, ten thousand dollars or more,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297682,
    "dDurationMs": 4662,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into or out of your account in a single\nday, your bank is required by law to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 302344,
    "dDurationMs": 2741,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "file a report about you with a federal\nagency."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 305666,
    "dDurationMs": 1660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not because you did anything wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307766,
    "dDurationMs": 4662,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is automatic paperwork, and for the\noverwhelming majority of people it goes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312428,
    "dDurationMs": 5543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "absolutely nowhere. The report is filed,\nit sits in a system, and nothing ever"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317971,
    "dDurationMs": 5882,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "comes of it. But here is the trap, and it\nis a cruel one, so listen very closely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324513,
    "dDurationMs": 4302,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The moment people hear about that ten\nthousand dollar line, their instinct"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328815,
    "dDurationMs": 5382,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is to duck under it. So they take out nine\nthousand today, and another nine"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 334197,
    "dDurationMs": 4622,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thousand next week, quietly congratulating\nthemselves for being private and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 338819,
    "dDurationMs": 3241,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "careful. That, right there, is a federal\ncrime."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 342641,
    "dDurationMs": 3741,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It has a name. It is called structuring."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346582,
    "dDurationMs": 4342,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Breaking up your own money into smaller\npieces to avoid the report is itself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350924,
    "dDurationMs": 5202,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "against the law, even when every single\ndollar is yours, earned honestly, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356126,
    "dDurationMs": 5102,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "already taxed. There are people in this\ncountry who have had their entire life"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 361228,
    "dDurationMs": 4662,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "savings seized over this, without ever\nbeing charged with any other crime at"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365890,
    "dDurationMs": 5923,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all. So hear me plainly. If the money is\nyours, you never need to hide it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 372073,
    "dDurationMs": 5082,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Move it in one honest transaction, let the\nharmless report file itself, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 377155,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you have nothing to fear."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 379076,
    "dDurationMs": 4902,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is the hiding, and never the money,\nthat the law reaches out and punishes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384578,
    "dDurationMs": 4522,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now the third rule, the one I asked\nyou to stay for, because it is the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389100,
    "dDurationMs": 4021,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one that can empty your account before you\nhave a chance to catch your breath."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 393942,
    "dDurationMs": 4562,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the IRS decides that you owe it money,\nit does not have to take you to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398504,
    "dDurationMs": 3501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "court. It does not have to stand before a\njudge and ask permission."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 402965,
    "dDurationMs": 4202,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It can simply send one piece of paper to\nyour bank, and your bank is required"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407167,
    "dDurationMs": 1741,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to freeze your account on the spot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409768,
    "dDurationMs": 2041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every dollar, locked in place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412609,
    "dDurationMs": 1561,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You cannot pay a bill with it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414490,
    "dDurationMs": 1361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You cannot buy your groceries."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 416491,
    "dDurationMs": 1501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You cannot even cover your rent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418872,
    "dDurationMs": 4522,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That frozen account is what the law calls\na levy, and it is the single most"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423394,
    "dDurationMs": 2881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "powerful reach the government has into\nyour money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426655,
    "dDurationMs": 4802,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there is one mercy built into this\nrule, and you must know it, because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431457,
    "dDurationMs": 3161,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it is your only window and most people\nwaste it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 434899,
    "dDurationMs": 4501,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When that freeze lands on your account,\nthe bank is required to hold your money"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 439400,
    "dDurationMs": 4512,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for twenty one days before it hands any of\nit over to the IRS."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443912,
    "dDurationMs": 4952,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Twenty one days. That waiting period is\nnot there for the bank's convenience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448864,
    "dDurationMs": 5342,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is there for you. It exists to give you\ntime to pick up the phone, call"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454206,
    "dDurationMs": 4362,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the IRS, correct a mistake if they have\nthe wrong person or the wrong amount,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459048,
    "dDurationMs": 5043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or set up a payment plan and get that\nfreeze lifted before your money is gone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464091,
    "dDurationMs": 540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 465511,
    "dDurationMs": 3822,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The people who lose everything are the\nones who spend those twenty one days"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 469333,
    "dDurationMs": 4922,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "frozen in panic. You will not be one of\nthem, because now you know exactly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474255,
    "dDurationMs": 3701,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what that clock is counting down, and\nexactly what to do with it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478376,
    "dDurationMs": 5503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And let me tell you plainly what those\ntwenty one days are for, so you never"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483879,
    "dDurationMs": 2121,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "freeze up if it ever lands on you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 486360,
    "dDurationMs": 4862,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The very first thing you do is call the\nnumber printed on that notice, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 491222,
    "dDurationMs": 2521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you do it that same day, not tomorrow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 494283,
    "dDurationMs": 2221,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You tell them you want to resolve it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496724,
    "dDurationMs": 5302,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the amount is wrong, or if it is not\neven your debt, you say so, and you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502026,
    "dDurationMs": 2661,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ask them what proof they need to fix it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504947,
    "dDurationMs": 4622,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If the debt is real but you cannot pay all\nof it at once, you ask to set up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 509569,
    "dDurationMs": 4502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a monthly payment plan, which on its own\ncan be enough to lift the freeze."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514611,
    "dDurationMs": 4362,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if paying it would leave you unable to\ncover your basic living costs, your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518973,
    "dDurationMs": 5062,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "food, your medicine, your rent, you tell\nthem that too, because there is a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524035,
    "dDurationMs": 4102,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "protected status for people in genuine\nhardship that can stop the collection"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 528137,
    "dDurationMs": 2521,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "altogether. The point is simple."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531298,
    "dDurationMs": 5262,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those twenty one days are a door, and it\nonly opens for the person who walks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 536560,
    "dDurationMs": 4822,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through it. And there is one more piece of\nthis third rule you have to hear,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 541622,
    "dDurationMs": 4782,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it catches even the most careful\nretirees completely off guard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547005,
    "dDurationMs": 4461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That same power reaches past your bank\naccount and into your Social Security"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551466,
    "dDurationMs": 5483,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "check. If you owe back taxes, the IRS is\nallowed to take fifteen percent"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 556949,
    "dDurationMs": 4562,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of your monthly Social Security payment,\nmonth after month, until that debt"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561511,
    "dDurationMs": 5982,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is paid off. On an average check, that is\na few hundred dollars quietly disappearing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567493,
    "dDurationMs": 6042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "every single month. Now, they must send\nyou a notice first, and you have"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 573535,
    "dDurationMs": 4302,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thirty days from that notice to arrange\nanother way to pay before the money"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 577837,
    "dDurationMs": 5723,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "starts coming out. But if you set that\nletter aside and ignore it, the deductions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 583560,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "simply begin on their own."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 586201,
    "dDurationMs": 3981,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the third rule is really a warning\nwrapped inside a rule."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 591043,
    "dDurationMs": 5282,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The IRS has a longer arm into your money\nthan almost anyone else alive, and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596325,
    "dDurationMs": 4462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "your only real protection is to open every\nletter it sends you and act inside"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600787,
    "dDurationMs": 5102,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the window it gives you. Now let me tie\nall three of these together, because"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 605889,
    "dDurationMs": 3701,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there is one single thread running through\nevery one of them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 610151,
    "dDurationMs": 3981,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "None of this comes hunting for you out of\nthe blue, and none of it is hidden"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614132,
    "dDurationMs": 1261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the way a scam is hidden."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616133,
    "dDurationMs": 5202,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is simply left unexplained, sitting\nquietly in the rules, in the hope that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 621335,
    "dDurationMs": 2721,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you never learn it and never think to ask."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 624817,
    "dDurationMs": 3821,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Your interest is always seen, so report\nevery dollar of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 629058,
    "dDurationMs": 5743,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A large deposit is completely harmless,\nbut hiding it is a crime, so never"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 634801,
    "dDurationMs": 5422,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "break up your own money. And the IRS can\nreach your account or your Social"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640223,
    "dDurationMs": 5382,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Security check without ever seeing a\njudge, so you open every letter it sends"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 645605,
    "dDurationMs": 2041,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you move inside the window."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648606,
    "dDurationMs": 4362,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Learn these three, and you stop being the\nperson these rules were quietly written"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652968,
    "dDurationMs": 4782,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to catch. This is general information to\nhelp you understand your own accounts,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 657750,
    "dDurationMs": 2661,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it is not legal or tax advice."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 661312,
    "dDurationMs": 4681,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If any of these three is touching you\nright now, one honest phone call to the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 665993,
    "dDurationMs": 5243,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "IRS or to a tax professional is worth far\nmore than staying silent and hoping"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 671236,
    "dDurationMs": 6042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it passes. And I have put the plain steps\nfor each of these three rules,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 677798,
    "dDurationMs": 4702,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the right offices to call, and where\nseniors can find free tax help,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 683221,
    "dDurationMs": 5202,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all in the description just below this\nvideo, so you have them the moment you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 688423,
    "dDurationMs": 580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "need them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 689783,
    "dDurationMs": 3782,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And before you go, I want you to do one\nsmall thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694065,
    "dDurationMs": 4242,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Think of one person you care about who\nkeeps their savings in the bank and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 698307,
    "dDurationMs": 2321,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has never once heard a word of this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 701188,
    "dDurationMs": 2621,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A parent still doing everything on their\nown."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 704189,
    "dDurationMs": 2401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A neighbor who worries about money in\nsilence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 707110,
    "dDurationMs": 3082,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "An old friend who would never see any of\nit coming."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710952,
    "dDurationMs": 5162,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Send them this video. It costs you\nnothing, and it may spare them the one mistake"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716114,
    "dDurationMs": 2261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that could cost them nearly everything."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 719395,
    "dDurationMs": 4722,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Watch your own mail, trust what you now\nknow, and take good care of one another."
    } ]
  } ]
}
